  "Smart Referee combines calibrated tracking, rules-aware review, and event delivery support to help organisers protect the run sheet and give every stakeholder a clearer account of the call.": "Smart Referee 結合經校準的追蹤、具規則識別的審核，以及活動執行支援，協助主辦方保障賽程表，並讓每位利害關係人都能更清楚地了解裁定依據。",
  "Smart Referee decision support": "Smart Referee 決策支援",
  "Smart Referee decision-support sections": "Smart Referee 決策支援章節",
  "Smart Referee is designed to support—not replace—official judgement. It gives referees stronger shared context so the game can remain transparent, consistent, and fair.": "Smart Referee 的設計是為了支援 — 而非取代 — 裁判的判斷。它為裁判提供更一致的共用脈絡，使比賽得以維持透明、一致與公平。",
  "Smart Referee links calibrated position data to the rule condition so officials, team representatives, and event operations can work from the same decision context.": "Smart Referee 將校準後的位置資料連結至規則條件，讓裁判、隊伍代表與賽事營運可在相同的決策脈絡下作業。",
