  "protected schedule.": "受保障的賽程。",
  "When a scoring moment is hard to see, Smart Referee gives officials a shared reviewable view—so your competition can move on with confidence.": "當得分瞬間難以看清時，Smart Referee 為裁判提供可共同檢視的視角，讓您的賽事能更有信心地繼續進行。",
  "Plan your event": "規劃您的賽事",
