  "What is Drone Sports Referee?": "甚麼是無人機運動裁判？",
  "A calibrated decision-support system that gives officials one shared, reviewable view of difficult scoring moments.": "一套經校準的判決支援系統，為裁判提供可共同檢視、可覆核的困難得分瞬間視角。",
  "Resolve close calls": "處理關鍵判決",
