  "Keep the next match moving": "讓下一場比賽順利進行",
  "Help the decision return to the field so the programme can continue with clarity.": "協助判決回到場上，讓賽程可以清晰地繼續進行。",
  "Align officiating standards": "統一裁判標準",
  "Apply the active event rule to the same calibrated position evidence for every review.": "每次覆核都將啟用中的賽事規則套用至相同、經校準的位置證據。",
  "Decision replay": "判決重播",
  "See the call, not just the": "看到判決，而不只是",
  "replay.": "重播。",
  "A single calibrated view helps officials review the relevant moment together, then return their attention to the event.": "單一經校準的視角協助裁判共同覆核相關瞬間，然後將注意力回到賽事上。",
  "One difficult moment. One shared view.": "一個關鍵瞬間。一個共同視角。",
  "A simple event workflow": "簡單的賽事流程",
  "From question to": "由疑問到",
  "shared call.": "共同判決。",
  "Officials remain central to the game. Smart Referee is there to make a difficult scoring moment easier to review without replacing human authority.": "裁判仍是比賽的核心。Smart Referee 協助更容易覆核困難的得分瞬間，但不取代人員裁判的權責。",
  "Set the event rule": "設定賽事規則",
  "Configure the scoring condition and review path around the format you are running.": "依照您正在舉辦的賽事形式，設定得分條件及覆核流程。",
  "Review the tracked moment": "覆核被追蹤的瞬間",
  "Bring the relevant position evidence into one shared view for the officials.": "將相關位置證據帶進裁判共同檢視的單一視角。",
  "Make the call together": "共同作出判決",
  "Officials keep their authority while working from the same reviewable context.": "裁判在保留權責的同時，根據相同且可覆核的情境作出判決。",
  "Organiser impact": "主辦方影響",
  "View an illustrative event-delay scenario": "查看示意性的賽事延誤情境",
  "One held call can affect more than the moment.": "一個被延後的判決，影響的不止當下。",
  "A scoring review can use the schedule buffer intended to protect the next match. The planning values below are discussion inputs, not measured outcomes or guaranteed savings.": "得分覆核可能會耗用原本用來保護下一場比賽的時間緩衝。下列規劃數值僅供討論，並非實測結果或保證節省。",
  "Built for event scale": "為賽事規模而設",
  "Technical confidence, when your team needs it.": "在團隊需要時提供技術信心。",
  "The Smart Referee system is designed to turn high-speed position data into a shared reference that can be prepared consistently for an event.": "Smart Referee 系統旨在把高速位置資料轉化為可在賽事前一致準備的共同依據。",
  "View tracking, setup, and rule-support details": "查看追蹤、設置及規則支援詳情",
  "Passive Tracking": "被動追蹤",
  "Passive tracking uses reflective markers that bounce infrared light from OptiTrack cameras back to the lens. It’s ideal for complex tracking volumes where cost-effective, lightweight markers are preferred.": "被動追蹤使用反光標記，將 OptiTrack 攝影機發出的紅外線反射回鏡頭。它適合複雜的追蹤空間，並可在需要具成本效益、輕巧標記時採用。",
  "Continuous calibration": "持續校準",
  "Zero Drift. Pure Precision.": "零漂移，純粹精準。",
  "Motive calibrates automatically and continuously with data collected during normal use of the system. No longer does your calibration degrade over time with changing temperatures or challenging building movement—it is always a “fresh” calibration.": "Motive 會利用系統正常運作時收集的資料，自動並持續地進行校準。校準不再因溫度變化或建築物晃動等環境挑戰而隨時間下降；它始終保持「最新」的校準狀態。",
  "Flex 13 illumination": "Flex 13 照明",
  "Unobtrusive infrared light": "不顯眼的紅外線光",
  "Flex 13 cameras emit 850nm IR light, which is nearly invisible, for inconspicuous illumination that prevents the vision fatigue and unwanted attention to your capture rig caused by cameras that emit visible spectrum light.": "Flex 13 攝影機發出幾乎不可見的 850nm 紅外線，提供不顯眼的照明，避免可見光攝影機為拍攝裝置帶來視覺疲勞及不必要的注意。",
  "Configurable competition rules": "可配置的競賽規則",
  "Smart Referee can be configured around an organisation’s active rule set, scoring conditions, and review workflow. Making the selected rules explicit in the operating configuration helps officials apply the intended standard consistently and reduces the risk that a rule is overlooked or incorrectly recalled under event pressure.": "Smart Referee 可依據組織採用中的規則集、得分條件及覆核流程進行配置。將已選規則明確納入營運設定，有助裁判一致地套用預定標準，並降低在賽事壓力下遺漏規則或錯誤回憶規則的風險。",
  "A focused overview of the Smart Referee workflow for organisers, officials, and delivery teams.": "為主辦方、裁判及執行團隊提供的 Smart Referee 工作流程重點概覽。",
  "Supplied rule and federation references are shown for event-context discussion only; their display does not indicate endorsement.": "已提供的規則及協會參考資料僅用於賽事情境討論；其展示不代表任何背書。",
  "Choose the support your": "選擇最適合您",
  "event needs.": "賽事需要的支援。",
  "Start with the delivery outcome that best fits your venue, event team, and level of decision support.": "從最適合您場地、賽事團隊及決策支援程度的交付成果開始。",
  "For organisers with core event infrastructure": "適合已有核心賽事基礎設施的主辦方",
